{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c8cea790e2714d3527668d04e50555d89f805f0df9e5129b67f404a4223b99fb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:085e26bb0f878390a496501203c51c24ab574877bff5db358589a6adb588b7c9",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，我是硲。\n面向下一次录制的舞蹈练习刚结束。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1451c3cc573a289dba51b31db0a1c5f8b7ddb50242751bf44ed7a7f681f97d64",
      "text": "我们4人接下来准备返回你那边。\n肯定能从容赶上碰头会的时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff067aa9fc91f10bb3a605949c68a4f59718ff32ffe1cd96846854219e412e9f",
      "text": "舞蹈练习顺利吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c498e70ac9a2b12ab2ec4012e22c0af98bef4866d47e77b9a9dd5288601a5a",
      "text": "动作已经记住了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d7f2534c737ef8240bb0b019b67761a1ba82bb8415c4ecf45393bf7932cb75",
      "text": "嗯，没问题。原本就是为了让小孩子们容易模仿\n而设计的简单动作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698a241f24dcb0a0d4721e8b1058d2ea71d7cb7ceb7a66abd694bb6560aff457",
      "text": "不过，从橘君身上能学到的东西很多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54fb819998eb9e6548b9b2f21483f942d6d23e0b90dae7e2fb983474d714a8b9",
      "text": "他说在跳舞的间隙，要面向一起跳舞的\n观众们进行呼吁呐喊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab679e5985dab4befe1eb67591ddb7b16311f61c2ccbad29f9ec2a435562f20a",
      "text": "他的脑海中想必已经清晰勾勒出\n屏幕另一端那些孩子们的模样了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb06758349291b631894f2c3edbd20c468cfe5aebe907a177c55126583405676",
      "text": "下次的录制中，我们将扮演学生，\n由橘君担任老师一角。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2643c381cdd250036000b23ed04ee6783825fddef1124f8a9a856f0db89662bf",
      "text": "即使在推进准备工作时，我们作为受教一方的\n情况也很多。这是一次很好的体验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_b:2_4_035_03_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32971f05d738c3ec298c2ea87fef47a7ec53029fabbd40b16470757ba0a293b6",
      "text": "等回到那边，再好好聊聊吧。\n那么，失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
